<title>USA: Los Angeles $94 mln COPs repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Los Angeles $94 mln COPs repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced Los Angeles Unified School District, Calif.'s $94.4 million certificates of participation issue, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2016 to 5.75 percent from approximately 5.776 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
